# The PAM service of the display (opengva-hmi.service): systemd opens a
# session for the "hmi" user on tty1 with it, and asks for nothing. The
# session is logind's (pam_systemd), and that is what lends the compositor
# the display and the input devices.
account   required  pam_permit.so
session   required  pam_systemd.so
